step s3plan: EXPLAIN (costs off) UPDATE mt SET v = mt.v * 10 + ms.w FROM ms WHERE mt.k = ms.k;
QUERY PLAN                             
---------------------------------------
Update on mt                           
  ->  Merge Join                       
        Merge Cond: (ms.k = mt.k)      
        ->  Index Scan using ms_k on ms
        ->  Index Scan using mt_k on mt
