----------------------------------------
Update on mbig                          
  ->  Merge Join                        
        Merge Cond: (mbs.k = mbig.k)    
        ->  Sort                        
              Sort Key: mbs.k           
              ->  Seq Scan on mbs       
        ->  Materialize                 
              ->  Sort                  
                    Sort Key: mbig.k    
                    ->  Seq Scan on mbig
